# Q3/OpenArena game data. No maps are committed to this repository: assets from
# a commercial Quake III Arena installation are not redistributable at all, and
# the licensing of individual OpenArena community maps is not documented per
# file. Fetch one locally instead — see the "Testing against a real map" section
# of the README. See also NOTICE.
*.pk3
*.bsp
*.aas
*.md3
*.skin
/assets/
/baseq3/
/baseoa/
/maps/
/test/render/output/

# GPL C sources fetched by `npm run download-assets --refs`. Read during porting
# and diffed against, never imported and never shipped. They are upstream's to
# distribute, not ours.
/refs/
